Inclusion Criteria:

1. Age range: 18 to 75 years old, both male and female are acceptable;
2. Patients with gastric adenocarcinoma or gastroesophageal junction adenocarcinoma diagnosed by histology or cytology;
3. Gastric cancer patients who have previously received first-line systemic chemotherapy (queue 1) or systemic chemotherapy combined with immunotherapy (queue 2) for progression; For intervention group 2, the best response to first-line immunotherapy is CR or PR or SD ≥ 3 months;
